    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1502118217240_440525_37021" xmi:uuid="14bffb25-03a7-4e5b-9a42-e9253aa0b7b6" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1512405145117_65132_42653" xmi:uuid="8d6ba348-c9f4-41ca-8327-6e004aaf91c8" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1502118217240_440525_37021"/>
        <body>A PartContactFeatureFitRelationship is a type of PartFeatureFitRelationship that is a relationship between two instances of the entity data type PartContactFeature stating that usages of these in an assembly can be joined with each other. &lt;note&gt;The &lt;a&gt;&lt;path&gt;./4_info_reqs_ElectricalHarness.htm#PartContactFeature.ElementOf&lt;/path&gt; ElementOf&lt;/a&gt; of the Related and Relating PartContactFeatures may be the same or different PartViews. &lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>PartContactFeatureFitRelationship</name>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1528792606149_49248_110725" xmi:uuid="5745d2df-e790-4f39-9746-5d95eba647aa" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714980365807_908204_149313" xmi:uuid="2eeba698-62f5-40e8-ac54-dfa9c5e1db75" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714980365807_110931_149314" xmi:uuid="94a2d9ff-9621-41e6-a803-02e6d940605b" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//ShapeElementRelationship[@uid and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='PartContactFeatureFitRelationship']"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="relatedPartContactFeature" value="child::Related/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="elementOfRelatedPartContactFeature" value="//*[@uid=$relatedPartContactFeature]/parent::*/@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="fitParentUid" value="child::FitParent/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="fitParentRelated" value="//*[@uid=$fitParentUid]/child::Related/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="fitParentRelating" value="//*[@uid=$fitParentUid]/parent::*/@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="elementOfRelatingPartContactFeature" value="parent::*/parent::*/@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="not(child::FitParent) or ($elementOfRelatedPartContactFeature eq $fitParentRelated and $elementOfRelatingPartContactFeature eq $fitParentRelating)"&gt;(PartContactFeatureFitRelationship.WR2 &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) if the FitParent is defined (&lt;sch:value-of select="$fitParentUid"/&gt;), then the ElementOf (&lt;sch:value-of select="$elementOfRelatedPartContactFeature"/&gt;) of the Related PartContactFeature (&lt;sch:value-of select="$relatedPartContactFeature"/&gt;) shall be the same instance as the Related (&lt;sch:value-of select="$fitParentRelated"/&gt;) instance of the FitParent and the ElementOf (&lt;sch:value-of select="$elementOfRelatingPartContactFeature"/&gt;) of the Relating PartContactFeature shall be the same instance as the Relating instance of the FitParent (&lt;sch:value-of select="$fitParentRelating"/&gt;).&lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1528792733948_694529_110732" xmi:uuid="8a44d983-4b58-40e7-b1cd-117c4dd37147" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1528792777163_419363_110735" xmi:uuid="fd5d4257-ca1c-4505-aa59-2a9cc39fb113" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_271a0567_1528792733948_694529_110732"/>
            <body>(Related.ElementOf :=: ParentRelationship.Related) AND (Relating.ElementOf :=: ParentRelationship.Relating); </body>
          </ownedComment>
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_271a0567_1528792606149_49248_110725"/>
          <body>if the FitParent is defined, then the &lt;a&gt;&lt;path&gt;./4_info_reqs_ElectricalHarness.htm#PartContactFeature.ElementOf&lt;/path&gt; ElementOf&lt;/a&gt; of the Related PartContactFeature shall be the same instance as the Related instance of the FitParent and the &lt;a&gt;&lt;path&gt;./4_info_reqs_ElectricalHarness.htm#PartContactFeature.ElementOf&lt;/path&gt; ElementOf&lt;/a&gt; of the Relating PartContactFeature shall be the same instance as the Relating instance of the FitParent.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR2</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1502118217240_440525_37021"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1528792606151_84756_110726" xmi:uuid="03fd5e2f-8bff-4ba6-9344-b33cc84eea7d" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>not self.FitParent.oclIsUndefined() implies (self.Related.ElementOf = self.FitParent.Related) and (self.Relating.ElementOf = self.FitParent.Relating) </body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1512405506116_321995_42658" xmi:uuid="cab6f232-bd49-4172-bd7a-5b2ea989d4d1" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1512405663238_181966_42661" xmi:uuid="37738fec-f241-439f-8f88-5fd8a1c1869d" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1528791700431_129645_110710" xmi:uuid="b9c97aff-c44d-4e8e-83e0-5252da0be868" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1512405663238_181966_42661"/>
            <body>((Related.Definition :=: Definition\ShapeFeatureDefinitionRelationship.Related) OR (Related.Definition :=: Definition\ShapeFeatureDefinitionElementRelationship.Related)) AND ((Relating.Definition :=: Definition\ShapeFeatureDefinitionRelationship.Relating) OR (Relating.Definition :=: Definition\ShapeFeatureDefinitionElementRelationshipRelating));</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1512405506116_321995_42658"/>
          <body>if a local Definition is defined, then the PartDefinition of the Related PartContactFeature shall be the same instance as the Related instance of the local Definition and the PartDefinition of the Relating PartContactFeature shall be the same instance as the relating instance of the local Definition.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714980365812_576023_149315" xmi:uuid="7dc67067-eaed-4e7f-b355-234d71aeafa1" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1714980365812_413290_149316" xmi:uuid="cc96f97d-a185-480a-8021-ea3fd3d1662a" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//ShapeElementRelationship[@uid and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='PartContactFeatureFitRelationship']"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="relatedPartContactFeature" value="child::Related/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="relatedPartDefinitionUid" value="//*[@uid=$relatedPartContactFeature]/PartDefinition/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="definitionUid" value="child::Definition/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="definitionRelatedUid" value="//*[@uid=$definitionUid]/Related/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="relatingPartDefinition" value="parent::*/PartDefinition/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="definitionRelating" value="//*[@uid=$definitionUid]/parent::*/@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="not(child::Definition) or (($relatedPartDefinitionUid eq $definitionRelatedUid ) and ($definitionRelating eq $relatingPartDefinition))"&gt; (PartContactFeatureFitRelationship.WR1 &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) if a local Definition (&lt;sch:value-of select="$definitionUid"/&gt;) is defined, then the PartDefinition (&lt;sch:value-of select="$relatedPartDefinitionUid"/&gt;) of the Related PartContactFeature (&lt;sch:value-of select="$relatedPartContactFeature"/&gt;) shall be the same instance as the Related instance of the local Definition (&lt;sch:value-of select="$definitionRelatedUid"/&gt;) and the PartDefinition (&lt;sch:value-of select="$relatingPartDefinition"/&gt;) of the Relating PartContactFeature shall be the same instance as the relating instance of the local Definition (&lt;sch:value-of select="$definitionRelating"/&gt;).&lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR1</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1502118217240_440525_37021"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1512405506116_199275_42659" xmi:uuid="33424a0e-96f8-4778-ad97-2ebd6c6416bb" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>not self.Definition.oclIsUndefined() implies ((self.Related.PartDefinition = self.Definition.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::ElectricalHarness::ContactFeatureDefinitionFitRelationship).Related) or (self.Related.PartDefinition = self.Definition.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::ShapeAssociationAndStructure::ShapeFeatureDefinitionElementRelationship).Related)) and ((self.Relating.PartDefinition = self.Definition.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::ElectricalHarness::ContactFeatureDefinitionFitRelationship).Relating) or (self.Relating.PartDefinition = self.Definition.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::ShapeAssociationAndStructure::ShapeFeatureDefinitionElementRelationship).Relating))</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1502118243923_919296_37066" xmi:uuid="11dee4f7-f02c-4ae1-8eca-0d28a5f9ddc3" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1524663721953_544548_72834"/>
      </generalization>
