          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193554_40935_25934"/>
          <body>the possible alternatives of CrossSectionalOccurrenceShapeElement or CrossSectionalPartShapeElement for a CrossSectionalAlternativePartShapeElement.</body>
        </ownedComment>
