          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193719_124889_27168"/>
          <body>an OccurrenceShapeElement of this WiringHarnessAssemblyDesign that is associated to the Vertex indicated by the RepresentedGeometry. The length of an Edge that starts or ends in this Vertex is measured from this feature. &lt;note&gt; The feature may represent a feature of the connector or a feature of a fixture unit that is attached to the node.&lt;/note&gt; The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
