            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//ShapeElement[@uid and local-fn:testXsiTypeOccurrenceShapeFeature(@xsi:type)=true()]"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="count(child::ProductDefinitional) = 0"&gt;(OccurrenceShapeFeature.WR1 &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) the inherited attribute ProductDefinitional must not be explicitly provided. It is implicitly set to TRUE.&lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR1</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1502369321169_378187_49175"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1720688738714_707554_131834" xmi:uuid="0e6c9894-816e-4bf1-b18c-8b2928b123c9" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>self.ProductDefinitional.oclIsUndefined()</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
